        "text": {
          "text": "真係我食過最好食嘅toast .ᐟ literally the BEST brunch toast combo yet imo🤌🏻\n\n✦ blueberry ricotta ($95)\n酸甜嘅藍莓 + 清新易入口嘅瑞可塔起司，再淋上蜂蜜真係完美嘅配搭🥹\nthe sweet & sour taste of the blueberries + light & soft ricotta cheese, with a drizzle of honey is literally the most clever delish combo🥹\n\n—\n\nʜᴋᴅ $100-150 𝗉𝗉\n𝙧𝙚𝙨𝙚𝙧𝙫𝙖𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣𝙨: no\n𝙧𝙚𝙫𝙞𝙨𝙞𝙩? yes\n𝙤𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙖𝙡𝙡: 8/10\n\n—\n\n📍 Fineprint (multiple branches)",
